Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:58.35,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.64,Main-207-,Pirate B,0,0,0,,{\an8}[PIRATE B] It's sorcery!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.73,Main-207-,Pirate C,0,0,0,,{\an8}[PIRATE C] Uh! He's a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.10,Main-207-,Pirate D,0,0,0,,{\an8}[PIRATE D] A magical freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.65,Main-207-,Pirate E,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E] He sent\NCaptain Kuro flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got treasure to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.13,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS]\NThe Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.51,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Say\Nyour prayers, butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.77,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Take\Nthat! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:44.10,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Game over,\Nyou lousy, no good pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! Those kids!\NWhat're they doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those rug rats have\Na death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know\Nwhat you're doing! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:00.95,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time, we'll let you off\Nwithout any more brutality!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now those stupid kids\Nhave really done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:10.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro\Nis gonna be so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.21,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You were fighting!\NGosh that is so totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought there were\Nno secrets between us pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That right! We're supposed\Nto tell each other everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, this is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta get\Noutta here! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:28.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to stay\Nand fight with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:34.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Usopp Pirates will be\Nshamed if we run in fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL wheezing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.96,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] You idiots!\NDon't scream, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [thud]\N– [KAYA gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:04:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.89,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.64,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm. My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's quite a strange technique\Nyou've developed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you have powers\Nfrom eating the devil fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Yep.\NI'm a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES whimpering, yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.58,Main-207-,Pirate D,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D] Ah!\NHe ate the devil fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:25.87,Main-207-,Pirate E,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E] That guy's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.79,Main-207-,Pirate F,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATE F] Those devil fruit people are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.25,Main-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G] He's got\Nrubber arms of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It all makes\Nperfect sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:34.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}didn't{\i0} just hallucinate\Nhis arms stretching out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:36.96,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can handle the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You take care of Miss Kaya\Nlike we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have her write\Nher butler into her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:49.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for the kids, they're\Nan eyesore. Eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:04.03,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna get to them, you'll have\Nto make it through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.62,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Butchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:15.96,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[BUTCHIE] Cat-tastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:59.80,Thoughts-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] No.\NStay away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.80,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:14.85,Main-207-,Kids,0,0,0,,[KIDS] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:17.11,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I need\Nyou to listen carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look. We're not running!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not after they did this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.70,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] We will avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect... Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.87,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Do as I say.\NDon't argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you the most important task\Nthere is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely critical\Nthat you succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take Kaya, and get\Naway from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the reason\Nwe wanted to be pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To protect what's dear to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So do as I say... and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:53.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go. That's a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:05.28,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Yes! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.32,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Kaya, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.28,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.37,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:10.70,Thoughts-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] He's sure got\Na way with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He made running\Naway sound brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:15.00,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] I know these woods\Nlike the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.17,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Sorry, I was gawking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those fools. Do they really think\Nthat they can escape me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:27.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JANGO screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– [thud]\N– [JANGO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JANGO growls] Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not a priority right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:44.69,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Their attempt\Nat escape is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know all too well\Nhow weak Kaya is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no way they can\Npossibly escape Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, if you want\Nto help her, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:08:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But first, you'll have to get\Noff this hill alive. Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.09,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO]\NButchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:13.01,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I guess losing to me once\Nwasn't enough for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:17.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you to get outta my way,\Nyou drooling tub of lard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUTCHIE yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onion, is that weird hypnotist guy\Nstill behind us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know I can't see\Nhim anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure\Nand lose him for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There's no way that nut job\Ncould catch up to us in our own forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.74,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Don't\Nyou worry, Miss Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Usopp Pirates are gonna\Nkeep you safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.00,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PEPPER] That's right!\NThe Usopp Pirates stand by their word!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:23.13,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:26.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:49.28,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Well,\Nthey're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fools, I'm coming to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Nyou can run from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:03.04,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\q2}[JANGO] We could do this the easy way,\Nor I could just level this entire forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.50,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Whoa!\NThat guy is really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.76,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] And he can do a lot\Nmore than just hypnotize people!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait... What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.11,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] That is the sound\Nof destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jango's probably tearing\Nthe place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:39.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. See for yourself\Nif you can get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heartless bastard! Don't you\Neven have a shred of pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You lived with that girl\Nfor three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:53.97,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KURO] No. I've told you, Kaya is nothing more\Nthan a pawn in the game I intend to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When she's dead, then\NI'll be grateful to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:00.56,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.47,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] This guy\Nis hopelessly evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.90,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] We should put\Nhim out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Go find the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll take\Ncare of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.\NYou can still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:31.92,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KURO] Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.30,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You betrayed the villager's\Ntrust. Not to mention
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:46.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you planned to take the life\Nof a sweet young girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the last time\Nyou ever get your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:02.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It hurts... It hurts so
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:09.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:12.92,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] You really are a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay on the ground there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:19.84,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Hah. Even if you did\Nsomehow catch up to Jango,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'd end your life\Nin the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Staying there is\Nwhat's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:26.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JANGO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:29.44,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:32.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care that I'm weak.\NI'll protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,937)}I'm Captain\Nof the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:39.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A brave warrior of the sea who\Nfights for what he holds dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:43.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will protect everyone\Nin the village if it kills me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:49.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On my word, you will never\Nset foot in that village!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.17,Main-207-,Pirate H,0,0,0,,[PIRATE H] What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:56.17,Secondary-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I] He's yellin'\Nabout something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.63,Main-207-,Pirate J,0,0,0,,[PIRATE J] Check it out\Nhe's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.40,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me and Usopp are gonna\Nchase down that hypno freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:23.28,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd be a whole lot faster\Nif I was going by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't know those woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so if we're gonna catch up\Nto them, I'm gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission\Nto go anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.84,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] {\i1}I{\i0} did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Zoro! Get goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:45.47,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Have another!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.73,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:58.23,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Man,\Nhe disappeared again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:01.82,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] The others got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the most important thing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:07.99,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Before I kill you,\NI feel compelled to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is an outsider like you butting\Ninto this villages' business for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Because there's\Na man in this village
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that I don't wanna let die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that being\Nthe reason that you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! But I'm not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:37.56,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] Gum-Gum Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is quite boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You cocky jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go east! Hey, I said go east!\NSo go east already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the wrong direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.30,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Fine, east.\NIs that left or right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.42,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Turn right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.63,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,[ZORO] But that's\Nwhere we came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAYA grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, ONION, CARROT gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:15.14,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] I'm sorry. You\Nshould go on with out me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.27,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] What\Nare you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are under strict orders\Nto protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:22.57,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Oh no! She's got\Na really bad fever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:24.65,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] What?!\NHang in there, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:25.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A doctor! We need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:28.16,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] You idiot!\NWe don't have time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone's tryin' to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.79,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] But it's dangerous\Nfor her to run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.08,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.46,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Show\Nyourselves, you runts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.43,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Thank you...\Nfor helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just the thought is more than enough.\NNow go, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did you brats go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:02.86,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PEPPER] If we left Kaya and ran away\Nright now, we would probably survive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.03,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Yeah. Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.86,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] And our Captain\Nalways said to run
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with your tail between your legs\Nif you think you're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then again,\Nour captain is a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But even {\i1}he{\i0} didn't take\Nhis own advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He tried so hard to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He risked his life for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CARROT sighs] I swore\Nto protect Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:29.18,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] Alright then! Prepare\Nyourselves, Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.22,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] We gotta fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:31.35,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:34.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop this! You're no match\Nfor him, you're only kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mustn't put your life\Non the line for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:40.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't wanna die,\Nwe have to fight for our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:43.18,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOwww.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He nicked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuro laid him out flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lotta good that devil fruit did him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's Captain Kuro for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.88,Main-207-,Pirates,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:07.05,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fools. This whole plan was devised,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so that I may be rid\Nof that name once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:20.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Concocting plans every day\Nfor a bunch of barbarians
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who care only\Nabout havoc and mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:27.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relentlessly attacked by\Ngovernment dogs and bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am sick and tired\Nof that entire cursed life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:36.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:39.71,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] The Navy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:43.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the third time this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, can you\Nreally blame them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:49.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You're one of the most famous pirates\Nsailing the seas right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro is a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:53.51,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:57.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,My infamy is\Nwhat draws them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going\Nto give up being Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:05.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wouldn't that be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:10.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Except... the Marines won't stop\Ntheir pursuit until Captain Kuro is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:14.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:17.58,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] I am going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:22.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It would seem that the tumultuous life\Nof a pirate just isn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.08,Flashbacks-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] You can't quit, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the ship's captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.59,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] You can be\Ncaptain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I have finally grown\Nweary of this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:39.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over. I'm killing\Nmyself for all to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:40.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir! Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:41.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:43.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.77,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] How many vessels are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,One! Just one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Captain?!\NShould we man the cannons?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We could blast them\Nto splinters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.49,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Lower a small boat\Ninto the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.36,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate S,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:55.20,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] A boat! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.62,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate S,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S] Vice Captain Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro just...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:01.66,Flashbacks-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:02.79,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate O,0,0,0,,[PIRATE O] "Yeah, I know"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous\Nfor him to go there by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.88,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate S,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S] Don't tell me\Nhe's turning himself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:23.73,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate R,0,0,0,,[PIRATE R] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.60,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G] The cannon fire stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.23,Flashbacks-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,[JANGO] Prepare\Nto board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.86,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate T,0,0,0,,[PIRATE T] But...\Nsir! Shouldn't we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for your opinion.\NThat's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.15,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate T,0,0,0,,[PIRATE T] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.24,FlashbacksSecondary-207-,Pirate R,0,0,0,,[PIRATE R] Better get ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:36.41,FlashbackThoughts-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\an8}[JANGO] I see.\NSo that's why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.86,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate H,0,0,0,,– [PIRATE H] On three!\N– [PIRATES yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:50.42,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate T,0,0,0,,[PIRATE T] The Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.67,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate V,0,0,0,,[PIRATE V] They've\Nbeen wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.63,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.81,Flashbacks-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Let's begin this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.23,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I was kind enough to let\Nyou and you alone survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:15.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:22.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not kneeling to you Finish me off\Nand get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:24.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,– [thud]\N– [MORGAN groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:31.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you can still howl this much with\Na shattered jaw, you should do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Today is the greatest day\Nof your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:39.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Today is the day\Nyou captured Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:42.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be ever\Nso grateful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:46.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you,\Nthe head of Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.27,Flashbacks-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[JANGO] Your name\Nis Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:52.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your name is Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}This atrocity was your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:58.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One. Two. Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:04.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Captain Kuro.\NThis atrocity was my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:08.79,Flashbacks-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)}[JANGO] And you are the brave Marine\Nwho caught the infamous Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:11.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Return to base and see\Nthat he gets executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:14.80,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:19.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the brave Marine who caught\Nthe infamous Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:22.22,Flashbacks-207-,Pirate W,0,0,0,,[PIRATE W] You're doing\Nit again, Vice Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:23.64,FlashbackThoughts-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:27.64,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When my double gets executed,\NCaptain Kuro will disappear from the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:30.48,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,and I will live\Nthe life I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.48,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,[KURO] And when my plan\Nsucceeds today,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after three years of planning,\Nrevising, and waiting;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.65,0:21:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my goal will be achieved\Nin its entirety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:44.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wealth {\i1}and{\i0} peace of mind\Nwill finally be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:51.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will {\i1}not{\i0} allow this perfect plan,\Nyears in the making, to fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:55.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My plan will not be disrupted\Nby an urchin like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would seem that you can do\Na lot more than just stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:05.60,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been toughening myself up\Nto be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what?\NDon't want a reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then don't be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:29.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just greedy, Kuro.\NBut I have ambition!
